{"unit_id":"Fishquito7__dsh-gitbash#feature-1","repo":"Fishquito7/dsh-gitbash","commit":"7e2ec81f4acaab3045bc650474f7e9770475c2d4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-bash 的功能「Git Bash 执行」：DSH 的 bash 工具可通过本地 Git Bash 执行命令。工具调用时插件把裸 bash 替换为解析出的 bash.exe 路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:234-260"]}
